WEBVTT

1
00:00:11.047 --> 00:00:13.247
were not going well for Amy March.

2
00:00:13.267 --> 00:00:20.049
"Oh, why, oh, why did I have to get these horrid limes," she lamented to herself.

3
00:00:21.850 --> 00:00:26.331
It's true that Amy wanted to be popular or at least liked by the popular girls.

4
00:00:27.491 --> 00:00:32.729
She had always wanted to be the center of attention and experience what it would be like to

5
00:00:32.769 --> 00:00:34.189
have everyone look up to her.

6
00:00:35.850 --> 00:00:39.031
She would get her wish shortly, but not in the way she hoped.

7
00:00:39.051 --> 00:00:41.392
"Miss March," Mr.

8
00:00:41.432 --> 00:00:45.133
Davis called to her, still hitting the menacing stick against his hand.

9
00:00:46.013 --> 00:00:50.294
Amy felt her throat go dry, and the hairs on her neck stood up stiff.

10
00:00:53.435 --> 00:00:55.216
"Stand up," the teacher ordered.

11
00:00:56.316 --> 00:01:01.659
Next to her, Amy could hear Kitty whimpering and from the corner of her eye, she saw Jenny

12
00:01:01.739 --> 00:01:03.140
smiling wickedly at her.

13
00:01:04.220 --> 00:01:04.861
That did it.

14
00:01:05.681 --> 00:01:07.262
Amy had disobeyed Mr.

15
00:01:07.302 --> 00:01:12.765
Davis' rule, but she was not a coward; she would accept whatever punishment fit the crime.

16
00:01:14.146 --> 00:01:20.629
Her parents had taught her that when she misbehaved, she should confess and face the consequences with dignity

17
00:01:20.869 --> 00:01:21.530
and humility.

18
00:01:22.330 --> 00:01:26.673
With shaking legs, and trying her best to hide her trembling hands, Amy stood up.

19
00:01:26.693 --> 00:01:29.794
"Do you have a bag of limes in your desk?"

20
00:01:30.134 --> 00:01:31.215
Mr. Davis asked.

21
00:01:31.235 --> 00:01:34.977
"Yes, sir, I do," Amy replied bluntly.

22
00:01:36.538 --> 00:01:43.082
All the girls gasped loudly and some of them (Amy suspected Kitty was one) even began crying.

23
00:01:43.102 --> 00:01:47.344
"Bring your bag and yourself up here."

24
00:01:48.084 --> 00:01:51.346
Mr. Davis tapped his desk at the front of the room with the stick.

25
00:01:53.127 --> 00:02:00.356
Reaching into her desk, Amy grabbed the bag of limes (nineteen still remaining) and began the dreaded walk

26
00:02:00.396 --> 00:02:01.056
to where Mr.

27
00:02:01.076 --> 00:02:01.697
Davis stood.

28
00:02:03.418 --> 00:02:07.921
Amy could feel the eyes of her classmates burning the back of her head as she passed them,

29
00:02:08.702 --> 00:02:10.423
but she refused to look at anyone.

30
00:02:12.084 --> 00:02:17.427
All she could think about was how disappointed Mother and her sisters would be after they heard about

31
00:02:17.487 --> 00:02:18.148
this incident.

32
00:02:19.952 --> 00:02:23.675
"Do you not know what I said about limes in my classroom?"

33
00:02:23.975 --> 00:02:27.257
Mr. Davis shouted suddenly, causing Amy to shrink back.

34
00:02:28.258 --> 00:02:33.322
Grabbing the bag of limes, he walked briskly to the window, opened it with his stick, and to

35
00:02:33.342 --> 00:02:37.725
the horror of all observers, emptied the contents onto the streets below.

36
00:02:39.206 --> 00:02:44.649
Then, turning around, he looked at Amy and said: "Miss March, you have greatly disappointed me.

37
00:02:45.950 --> 00:02:50.057
I do not delight in what I am about to do, but I am a man who keeps

38
00:02:50.117 --> 00:02:50.697
his word."

39
00:02:51.757 --> 00:02:56.739
He walked over to her and commanded her to open her hands, palms facing upward.

40
00:02:57.479 --> 00:03:03.521
Lifting the stick high above his head, he slapped her palms once, twice, then three times more.

41
00:03:04.961 --> 00:03:09.302
Each slap, painful as it was, was nothing compared to how the teacher hurt Amy next.

42
00:03:09.322 --> 00:03:16.870
"To remind others who think they can get away with breaking my rules, you, Miss March, will stand

43
00:03:16.930 --> 00:03:22.075
here in front of the class for the remainder of the morning lesson, as a living example of

44
00:03:22.136 --> 00:03:27.741
what happens to those who disrespect, disobey, and disregard my words."

45
00:03:29.343 --> 00:03:34.368
Mr. Davis positioned Amy in front of the blackboard so that everyone in the class had a clear

46
00:03:34.448 --> 00:03:38.172
view of her and would have to continue to look at her shame throughout the morning.

47
00:03:39.172 --> 00:03:44.876
For Amy, this was the most humiliating, not to mention most heartbreaking experience she ever had in her

48
00:03:44.936 --> 00:03:51.781
life. She acknowledged her wrongdoing and willingly received the punishment of five slaps on her hands.

49
00:03:52.762 --> 00:03:58.646
This, however, to be displayed like a common criminal, was too excessive and unbearable for the young girl.

50
00:03:59.606 --> 00:04:05.870
Still, she kept her head high, refused to let the teacher or her classmates see her internal suffering,

51
00:04:06.351 --> 00:04:07.892
and did not shed a single tear.

52
00:04:08.932 --> 00:04:15.037
Even so, at that precise moment Amy resolved in her heart that she would never return to school

53
00:04:15.077 --> 00:04:19.600
again. After Amy got home, she spilled her heart out to her family.

54
00:04:20.400 --> 00:04:26.745
Everyone, including Beth, who usually saw the good in all people and situations, agreed that Mr.

55
00:04:26.785 --> 00:04:28.546
Davis behaved inappropriately.

56
00:04:28.566 --> 00:04:30.788
"Poor Amy.

57
00:04:30.808 --> 00:04:36.552
I wish I could have taken your place," Beth wept along with her younger sister.

58
00:04:37.748 --> 00:04:38.869
"Take her place?"

59
00:04:39.350 --> 00:04:43.754
shouted Jo, who stopped pacing to throw her fist up and shake it vigorously.

60
00:04:43.774 --> 00:04:49.539
"If it were me, I would have smacked him right across the jaw and knock him down!

61
00:04:50.380 --> 00:04:52.602
In fact, I think I just may do that!

62
00:04:53.502 --> 00:04:56.425
How dare he humiliate my sister in this way?"

63
00:04:57.346 --> 00:05:03.892
For once Amy did not rebuke Jo for her unladylike behavior or her aggressive boyish attitudes.

64
00:05:04.936 --> 00:05:11.421
Mother, however, was concerned, although in her heart, she was in complete agreement with her short-tempered daughter.

65
00:05:12.782 --> 00:05:14.604
"Jo, where will violence get you?

66
00:05:15.485 --> 00:05:18.567
Do you think taking revenge is the solution to this problem?"

67
00:05:19.508 --> 00:05:22.270
Jo, cracking her knuckles, did not answer her mother.

68
00:05:23.171 --> 00:05:28.955
Mother continued in a patient yet firm voice: "Violent thoughts lead to violent acts.

69
00:05:30.116 --> 00:05:34.340
Your father and I do not want any of our girls to be revengeful.

70
00:05:35.308 --> 00:05:38.649
We must think with our heads; not react with our hearts."

71
00:05:39.610 --> 00:05:43.551
"I agree with you, Mother, but I can understand Jo's point of view as well.

72
00:05:44.492 --> 00:05:45.892
I don't think we should allow Mr.

73
00:05:45.932 --> 00:05:50.854
Davis to get away with such maltreatment of his pupils," Meg unexpectedly spoke up.

74
00:05:51.955 --> 00:05:56.077
Nodding, Mother soothed her youngest daughter's head which was lying across her lap.

75
00:05:56.597 --> 00:06:01.899
Looking down at her, "Amy, dearest, you are the victim of this distressing affair.

76
00:06:02.799 --> 00:06:04.300
What do you think should be done?"

77
00:06:05.304 --> 00:06:12.087
Sniffing and hiccupping, Amy answered in a hoarse voice: "I want to forget everything that happened today.

78
00:06:12.867 --> 00:06:14.888
But I don't want to go back to school.

79
00:06:15.969 --> 00:06:16.849
I can't, Mother.

80
00:06:16.869 --> 00:06:18.410
I won't learn from him.

81
00:06:18.430 --> 00:06:19.670
I don't want to."

82
00:06:20.671 --> 00:06:24.172
Mother continued to stroke her hair, considering Amy's request.

83
00:06:24.192 --> 00:06:29.294
"Amy and I could homeschool together, Mother," suggested Beth.

84
00:06:30.575 --> 00:06:34.837
"It will be so much nicer for me to have a fellow pupil than to do my lessons

85
00:06:34.917 --> 00:06:35.497
on my own."

86
00:06:36.638 --> 00:06:40.021
"Please, Mother, may I stay at home with Beth and study here?

87
00:06:40.781 --> 00:06:44.444
Please don't send me back to that dreadful place," pleaded Amy.

88
00:06:44.464 --> 00:06:51.109
"I can spare a few hours a week helping the girls with their lessons," offered Jo, who thought

89
00:06:51.169 --> 00:06:52.910
Amy's idea was an excellent one.

90
00:06:52.930 --> 00:06:56.673
"And I can check their homework," proposed Meg.

91
00:06:57.814 --> 00:07:00.896
Mother looked at each daughter with approval and appreciation.

92
00:07:01.748 --> 00:07:04.269
"Yes, I think that will be the best for now.

93
00:07:05.229 --> 00:07:10.111
Of course after Father returns from the war, he will have the final say in the matter.

94
00:07:11.051 --> 00:07:14.792
For now, however, Amy, you may stay home and do your lessons."

95
00:07:15.932 --> 00:07:18.993
Happily, Amy sprang up and hugged her mother and sisters.

96
00:07:19.013 --> 00:07:24.095
"But you must promise to listen to your sisters and do your work.

97
00:07:24.915 --> 00:07:28.116
Studying at home will be no different from studying at school.

98
00:07:29.024 --> 00:07:29.885
Do you understand?"

99
00:07:30.225 --> 00:07:32.046
Mother asked in a warning tone.

100
00:07:32.066 --> 00:07:36.488
"Yes, Mother, I promise to faithfully do my lessons.

101
00:07:37.389 --> 00:07:39.270
Beth and I will be model pupils.

102
00:07:39.590 --> 00:07:43.912
Just you wait and see," Amy replied in her usual cheery way.

103
00:07:45.053 --> 00:07:49.115
Early the next morning, Mother paid a visit to Amy's school and teacher.

104
00:07:50.196 --> 00:07:55.879
She kindly thanked him for his efforts, collected Amy's belongings, and with a cool nod, left without a

105
00:07:55.939 --> 00:07:56.660
backward glance.
